.el .ds Aq '
.TH ldc 1  "ldc 0.1.0" 
.SH NAME
ldc \- LDIR compiler CLI: compile documents to PDF and other formats
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBldc\fR [\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-f\fR|\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-\-font\fR] [\fB\-\-font\-mono\fR] [\fB\-\-font\-path\fR] [\fB\-\-list\-fonts\fR] [\fB\-\-title\fR] [\fB\-\-author\fR] [\fB\-\-subject\fR] [\fB\-\-margin\fR] [\fB\-\-page\-size\fR] [\fB\-\-page\-width\fR] [\fB\-\-page\-height\fR] [\fB\-\-header\-left\fR] [\fB\-\-header\-center\fR] [\fB\-\-header\-right\fR] [\fB\-\-footer\-left\fR] [\fB\-\-footer\-center\fR] [\fB\-\-footer\-right\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-header\-rule\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-footer\-rule\fR] [\fB\-\-drop\-caps\fR] [\fB\-\-bibliography\fR] [\fB\-\-lir\fR] [\fB\-\-pdfa\-level\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] [\fIINPUTS\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
LDIR Compiler — compile documents to PDF and other formats.
.PP
Input formats: .md, .tex, .typ, .html, .htm, .adoc, .org, .docx (auto\-detected) Output formats: .pdf, .html, .epub, .txt, .docx, .sir2, .ldir (\-\-format or auto\-detected)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fI<OUTPUT>\fR
Output file path. Defaults to first input stem + extension based on format
.TP
\fB\-f\fR, \fB\-\-format\fR \fI<FORMAT>\fR [default: pdf]
Output format
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
pdf
.IP \(bu 2
gir
.IP \(bu 2
sir
.IP \(bu 2
html
.IP \(bu 2
epub
.IP \(bu 2
txt
.IP \(bu 2
docx
.IP \(bu 2
sir2
.IP \(bu 2
ldir
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-font\fR \fI<FONT_FAMILY>\fR
Primary font family name (e.g., "DejaVu Sans", "Noto Serif"). Auto\-detected from system fonts if not specified
.TP
\fB\-\-font\-mono\fR \fI<FONT_FAMILY>\fR
Monospace font family name (e.g., "DejaVu Sans Mono"). Auto\-detected from system fonts if not specified
.TP
\fB\-\-font\-path\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Path to primary font file (.ttf/.otf). Overrides \-\-font when specified
.TP
\fB\-\-list\-fonts\fR
List available system fonts and exit
.TP
\fB\-\-title\fR \fI<TITLE>\fR
Document title for PDF metadata
.TP
\fB\-\-author\fR \fI<AUTHOR>\fR
Document author for PDF metadata
.TP
\fB\-\-subject\fR \fI<SUBJECT>\fR
Document subject for PDF metadata
.TP
\fB\-\-margin\fR \fI<INCHES>\fR [default: 1]
Page margin in inches (applied uniformly to all sides)
.TP
\fB\-\-page\-size\fR \fI<SIZE>\fR
Page size preset ("a4", "letter", "legal")
.TP
\fB\-\-page\-width\fR \fI<WIDTH_PT>\fR
Custom page width in points (overrides \-\-page\-size)
.TP
\fB\-\-page\-height\fR \fI<HEIGHT_PT>\fR
Custom page height in points (overrides \-\-page\-size)
.TP
\fB\-\-header\-left\fR \fI<TEMPLATE>\fR
Header left template (supports %page, %pages, %title, %author, %date)
.TP
\fB\-\-header\-center\fR \fI<TEMPLATE>\fR
Header center template
.TP
\fB\-\-header\-right\fR \fI<TEMPLATE>\fR
Header right template
.TP
\fB\-\-footer\-left\fR \fI<TEMPLATE>\fR
Footer left template
.TP
\fB\-\-footer\-center\fR \fI<TEMPLATE>\fR
Footer center template
.TP
\fB\-\-footer\-right\fR \fI<TEMPLATE>\fR
Footer right template (default: %page)
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-header\-rule\fR
Disable header rule line
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-footer\-rule\fR
Disable footer rule line
.TP
\fB\-\-drop\-caps\fR
Enable drop caps for the first paragraph after headings
.TP
\fB\-\-bibliography\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Path to BibTeX (.bib) file for citations
.TP
\fB\-\-lir\fR
Use the L\-IR layout pipeline (S\-IR → L\-IR → G\-IR) instead of direct compilation
.TP
\fB\-\-pdfa\-level\fR \fI<LEVEL>\fR [default: 4]
PDF/A conformance level ("4" for PDF/A\-4, "2b" for PDF/A\-2b)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
[\fIINPUTS\fR]
Input file(s). Multiple files are merged with offset IDs. Supported: .md, .tex, .typ, .html, .htm, .adoc, .org, .docx
.SH VERSION
v0.1.0
